    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardboard Cowboy is a Western shooter set in a world made entirely out of cardboard!\u00a0Survive shooting galleries, collect tarot cards, and use various cardboard firearms in different locations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/4e9b1bcc6e3a76059cdfdfbdd63ddb49.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.poster.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.webm?t=1754763410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.mp4?t=1754763410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the timed weapon challenges for extra loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up kills and headshots to set high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple ending missions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/9c454cf8d2e4401afc94185edfebb9a3.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tarot cards for passive traits and active abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tarot cards to become the ultimate gunslinger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ability cards to shoot incendiary, poison, or ricochet ammo</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/f1c7544e532dd19cb79b7b651abfbdcb.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide array of handmade cardboard firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual-wield combinations of rapid-fire revolvers and powerful shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim all 12 Deadly Dozen bounties to unlock powerful post-game weapons</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/dcc8f04e98f8938f6ac6bb5bbb3f62d3.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/d389cedb04d223a716ef864211edd478.avif?t=1754763410\" width=1300 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down outlaws in the sleepy town of Bottomwater</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun down bootleggers at the shady port of Luck\u2019s Landing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the CalCo. Mines to smoke out human varmint</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardboard Cowboy is a Western shooter set in a world made entirely out of cardboard!\u00a0Survive shooting galleries, collect tarot cards, and use various cardboard firearms in different locations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/4e9b1bcc6e3a76059cdfdfbdd63ddb49.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.poster.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.webm?t=1754763410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.mp4?t=1754763410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the timed weapon challenges for extra loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up kills and headshots to set high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple ending missions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/9c454cf8d2e4401afc94185edfebb9a3.avif?t=1754763410\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tarot cards for passive traits and active abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tarot cards to become the ultimate gunslinger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ability cards to shoot incendiary, poison, or ricochet ammo</p></li></ul><h2 clas